e_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-12T08:24:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:45:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in master (232e6b14a)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (232e6b14a) - Android 17 - Pixel 6 (Mali-G78) - Vulkan (Mobile)\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn my Pixel 6, creating a texture proxy of an ASTC-compressed texture crashes with a SIGSEGV inside the Mali driver, on the Vulkan thread:\n\n```\nF libc: Fatal signal 11 (SIGSEGV), code 1 (SEGV_MAPERR) in tid ... (VkThread)\n#00 pc 000000000094bed0  /vendor/lib64/egl/libGLES_mali.so (vkCreateImageView+576)\n#01 pc ...  libgodot_android.so\n```\n\nI've only hit it through `texture_proxy_create`. An `AnimatedTexture` with ASTC frames didn't crash for me.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP and export it for Android (Mobile renderer, Vulkan, ETC2/ASTC import on).\n2. Run it on a device with `VK_EXT_astc_decode_mode`.\n3. It crashes within a few seconds of starting.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[astc-proxy-crash-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33327221/astc-proxy-crash-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124392/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124392/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}